msgid "music;sound;audio;player;waveform;"
msgstr "音乐;声音;音频;播放器;波形;music;audio;player;"

#: apps/audio-player/data/org.helixdesktop.AudioPlayer.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Audio Player plays a single audio file with a clear waveform to see and seek "
"through. Playback can be controlled entirely from the keyboard, and the "
"media keys and the desktop's media controls work too."
msgstr ""
"音频播放器可播放单个音频文件，并显示清晰的波形，方便查看和跳转。播放完全可以"
"通过键盘控制，媒体键和桌面的媒体控件也同样可用。"

