#: apps/tour/data/org.helixdesktop.Tour.metainfo.xml
msgid "Get to know the desktop"
msgstr "了解桌面"

#: apps/tour/data/org.helixdesktop.Tour.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Tour introduces the Helix desktop the first time you log in. Learn how to "
"start apps, switch between them and find your way around."
msgstr ""
"导览会在您首次登录时介绍 Helix 桌面。了解如何启动应用、在应用之间切换以及熟悉"
"桌面环境。"

#: apps/tour/data/org.helixdesktop.Tour.metainfo.xml
msgid "introduction"
msgstr "介绍"

#: apps/tour/data/org.helixdesktop.Tour.metainfo.xml
msgid "tour"
msgstr "导览"

#: apps/tour/data/org.helixdesktop.Tour.metainfo.xml
msgid "welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:13
msgid "Welcome to Helix"
msgstr "欢迎使用 Helix"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:15
msgid ""
"Helix is a fast, friendly desktop written in Rust. Take a quick look around "
"— it only takes a minute."
msgstr "Helix 是一款用 Rust 编写的快速、友好的桌面。花一分钟快速浏览一下吧。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:20
msgid "The Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:21
msgid ""
"Press the <b>Super</b> key to step back and see everything at once: your "
"workspaces along the top and live previews of your open windows. Click a "
"window to jump to it, or just start typing to search. <b>Super+Alt+Up</b> "
"and <b>Super+Alt+Down</b> move between the desktop, the overview and the app "
"launcher."
msgstr ""
"按 <b>Super</b> 键即可总览全局：顶部是您的工作区，下方是已打开窗口的实时预"
"览。点击某个窗口即可跳转到该窗口，或直接开始输入进行搜索。<b>Super+Alt+Up</"
"b> 和 <b>Super+Alt+Down</b> 可在桌面、概览和应用启动器之间切换。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:31
msgid "Launching Apps"
msgstr "启动应用"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:32
msgid ""
"Click <b>Apps</b> in the top panel or press <b>Super+A</b> to open the "
"launcher. Open windows come first, followed by every installed app. Type a "
"few letters to narrow the list, then press <b>Enter</b> to start it."
msgstr ""
"点击顶部面板中的<b>应用</b>或按 <b>Super+A</b> 打开启动器。已打开的窗口排在最"
"前面，其后是所有已安装的应用。输入几个字母以缩小列表范围，然后按 <b>Enter</"
"b> 启动。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:41
msgid ""
"Spread your work across workspaces to keep things tidy. <b>Super+Page Up</b> "
"and <b>Super+Page Down</b> switch between them; add <b>Shift</b> to take the "
"current window with you. The dots in the top panel show where you are, and "
"by default a fresh, empty workspace is always waiting at the end."
msgstr ""
"将工作分散到多个工作区中，让一切井井有条。<b>Super+Page Up</b> 和 "
"<b>Super+Page Down</b> 可在工作区之间切换；同时按住 <b>Shift</b> 可将当前窗口"
"一起带走。顶部面板中的圆点显示您所在的位置，默认情况下，末尾始终有一个新的空"
"工作区。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:49
msgid "Managing Windows"
msgstr "管理窗口"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:50
msgid ""
"Drag a window by its header bar. Drop it against the left or right edge of "
"the screen to fill that half, or against the top edge to maximize it. From "
"the keyboard, <b>Super+Left</b> and <b>Super+Right</b> tile, <b>Super+Up</b> "
"maximizes and <b>Super+Down</b> restores. <b>Alt+Tab</b> switches apps and "
"<b>Alt+Space</b> opens the window menu."
msgstr ""
"拖动窗口的标题栏即可移动窗口。将其拖到屏幕的左边缘或右边缘可占满该半边，拖到"
"顶部边缘可将其最大化。使用键盘时，<b>Super+Left</b> 和 <b>Super+Right</b> 用"
"于平铺，<b>Super+Up</b> 用于最大化，<b>Super+Down</b> 用于还原。<b>Alt+Tab</"
"b> 用于切换应用，<b>Alt+Space</b> 用于打开窗口菜单。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:60
msgid "Touchpad Gestures"
msgstr "触摸板手势"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:61
msgid ""
"On a touchpad, swipe sideways with <b>three or four fingers</b> to glide to "
"the next or previous workspace. Tap-to-click, natural scrolling and pointer "
"speed can be adjusted in <b>Settings</b>."
msgstr ""
"在触摸板上用<b>三指或四指</b>横向轻扫，即可滑动到下一个或上一个工作区。轻触点"
"击、自然滚动和指针速度可在<b>设置</b>中调整。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:69
msgid "Getting Help"
msgstr "获取帮助"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:70
msgid ""
"Stuck? The <b>Help</b> app has guides for the desktop and your apps — search "
"for it in the launcher. Most apps also offer help from their main menu or "
"with <b>F1</b>."
msgstr ""
"遇到困难？<b>帮助</b>应用提供桌面和各应用的指南——在启动器中搜索即可找到。大多"
"数应用也可以通过主菜单或按 <b>F1</b> 获取帮助。"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:78
msgid "That's it! Have a nice day"
msgstr "就是这样！祝您愉快"

#: apps/tour/src/pages.rs:79
msgid ""
"You're ready to go. You can take this tour again at any time by searching "
"for <b>Tour</b> in the launcher."
msgstr "一切准备就绪。您可以随时在启动器中搜索<b>导览</b>来再次进行此导览。"

